  "created": "2026-11-19T22:34:20.757Z",
  "description": "Provides SkiaSharp integration for the FFmpeg .NET wrapper (FFmpegDotNet).\n\t\t\tConverts FFmpeg AVFrames to SKImage or SKBitmap and back, with crop, color space (YUV matrix, range, HDR) and alpha handling, and includes high-level classes (FFCodec2Skia, SKVideo, SKAnimatedImage) for decoding and rendering videos and animated images with Skia.\n\t\t\tThe package version starts with the FFmpeg major version: 8.x for FFmpegDotNet 8 (FFmpeg 8.1), 9.x for FFmpegDotNet 9 (FFmpeg 9.0).",
